    "comment": "A minimal, hand-written capture of the checkout example's four HTTP exchanges. Every entry is named with the _id the scaffolder addresses it by, so `rogojin request checkout get-homepage --har _examples/captures/checkout.har --entry get-homepage` reproduces it. The homepage is HTML, so nothing types from it; the variant comes from the JSON get-product call after it.",
    "entries": [
